<!-- FAQ -->
<section style="padding:5rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;">
  <div class="container">
    <p style="font-size:0.65rem; letter-spacing:0.25em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#e00; margin-bottom:1rem;">Common Questions</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.5vw,2rem); font-weight:200; color:#fff; margin-bottom:2.5rem;">Apparel manufacturing — frequently asked</h2>
    <div style="max-width:760px;">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-q">What production models do apparel manufacturers offer?</p>
        <p class="faq-a">Certified apparel manufacturers typically offer OEM (produce to your specifications), ODM/private label (factory handles design and production), and CMT (you supply fabric, factory cuts, sews, finishes). SDF offers all three from 300 pieces per style.</p>
      </div>
